      "description": "The IRIS CDN Exporter's BPMN processes (issue #100): initial load, nightly change ingest over DSpace REST, weekly reconciliation, and sign-and-publish. Cloudflare git (Artifacts) and Cloudflare R2 + CDN are lanes, because the owner ruled 2026-10-30 that exports live on Cloudflare and GitHub Pages only previews. Each activity names the skill that carries it out; the platform's nquads-distribution process is called, not copied. Rendered drawings: docs/assets/img/processes/.",
