      "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
      "description": "The first full export of WHO IRIS onto Cloudflare (git on Artifacts, bytes in R2): every item record and every bitstream: metadata plus PDFs. Run in batches with a checkpoint, so a run that stops resumes where it stopped and never re-fetches what it already holds. Ends in one signed, verified release.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "flowCount": 16,
